160
00:06:42,409 --> 00:06:45,379
- The used-up toothpaste? - Yes. That's quite useful.

161
00:06:45,379 --> 00:06:47,509
- Yes. - There's a lot left inside.

162
00:06:48,179 --> 00:06:50,049
