166
00:06:59,589 --> 00:07:00,859
- She's not hesitant. - Right.

167
00:07:02,259 --> 00:07:03,329
Okay.

168
00:07:03,329 --> 00:07:04,429
(In no time, she cuts open the tube.)

169
00:07:05,129 --> 00:07:06,429
