173
00:07:13,099 --> 00:07:14,909
(Monday: Shake out the blankets, Tuesday: Clean the shelves...)

174
00:07:14,909 --> 00:07:16,039
- My goodness. - My gosh.

175
00:07:16,039 --> 00:07:17,109
Oh, my.

176
00:07:17,709 --> 00:07:19,409
- My gosh. - What's that? I should buy it too.

177
00:07:20,379 --> 00:07:21,909
