178
00:07:21,909 --> 00:07:23,349
really useful.

179
00:07:23,349 --> 00:07:25,179
You can check the progress when you put it on the door.

180
00:07:25,179 --> 00:07:26,579
- You keep seeing it. - Yes.

181
00:07:26,789 --> 00:07:29,019
