186
00:07:36,389 --> 00:07:38,529
So I'm going to clean the washer too.

187
00:07:38,759 --> 00:07:40,229
The shine lasts longer...

188
00:07:40,229 --> 00:07:41,729
- with toothpaste. - That's right.

189
00:07:41,929 --> 00:07:43,499
I always run the washer...

190
00:07:43,499 --> 00:07:45,039
