191
00:07:47,009 --> 00:07:49,209
(Grabbing)

192
00:07:50,779 --> 00:07:54,009
(She grabs an empty water bottle and sits on the floor.)

193
00:07:55,279 --> 00:07:57,419
(Covering the floor)

194
00:07:58,279 --> 00:08:00,419
(She's placing the empty bottle in front of the drainage hole.)

195
00:08:01,119 --> 00:08:04,189
(She grabs the drainage hose with one hand.)

196
