- Right. - What's she doing?

197
00:08:06,389 --> 00:08:08,129
(Inserting a stick)

198
00:08:13,569 --> 00:08:14,799
You're draining the water.

199
00:08:14,999 --> 00:08:16,229
- If I don't do that, - Right.

200
00:08:16,229 --> 00:08:18,099
- I'd be washing my clothes in mold. - That's right.

201
00:08:18,099 --> 00:08:20,239
(A cleaning task to remove mold from the water)

202
00:08:20,709 --> 00:08:23,169
If you try that at home, you'll see a lot of dirt and mold.

203
00:08:24,579 --> 00:08:26,109
(Removing)

204
00:08:26,949 --> 00:08:30,349
(She disassembles the detergent box.)

205
00:08:31,619 --> 00:08:34,349
