208
00:08:43,559 --> 00:08:46,829
(She grabs a toothbrush right away.)

209
00:08:46,829 --> 00:08:49,399
(Scrubbing)

210
00:08:49,499 --> 00:08:51,869
- It's so moldy inside the seal. - Right.

211
00:08:52,169 --> 00:08:53,539
- Just check it just once. - Right.

212
00:08:53,539 --> 00:08:54,739
- It smells awful. - That's true.

213
00:08:54,739 --> 00:08:55,809
- Great. - Really?

214
00:08:55,869 --> 00:08:57,109
She's that thorough?

215
00:08:57,509 --> 00:09:00,079
Where do you get this kind of information?

216
00:09:00,779 --> 00:09:01,849
- Wait. - That was random.

217
00:09:01,849 --> 00:09:03,749
- "Where do you get it?" - "Where do you get it?"

218
00:09:03,749 --> 00:09:05,549
My mom gave me some tips.

219
00:09:05,549 --> 00:09:07,219
Because I only look up cleaning products,

220
00:09:07,219 --> 00:09:08,249
- Right. - I only see videos...

221
00:09:08,249 --> 00:09:09,519
- about cleaning tips on my feed. - Right.

222
00:09:09,519 --> 00:09:12,189
- Your feed is all about cleaning. - Yes.

223
00:09:12,189 --> 00:09:14,559
I bet her feed and my feed are about the same.

224
00:09:14,759 --> 00:09:16,129
I watch a lot of videos from cleaning crews...

225
00:09:16,129 --> 00:09:17,159
- Right? - on YouTube.

226
00:09:17,159 --> 00:09:18,859
- Does that make you feel good? - Yes.

227
00:09:21,529 --> 00:09:22,599
(Excited)

228
00:09:22,599 --> 00:09:25,299
- There's a famous guy for it. - Just now, she...

229
00:09:25,499 --> 00:09:27,709
- Yes. - She just hit a fourth-octave note.

230
00:09:28,439 --> 00:09:30,379
- There's a famous guy, right? - They're my teachers.

231
00:09:31,109 --> 00:09:33,479
(Scrubbing hard)

232
00:09:34,149 --> 00:09:36,549
(This should do it for the inside.)

233
00:09:41,089 --> 00:09:43,719
(Next, she disassembles the drainage hole.)

234
00:09:44,519 --> 00:09:47,229
- That's where the dirt comes out. - Right.

235
00:09:49,759 --> 00:09:51,099
(She covers it with an alcohol wet wipe.)

236
00:09:53,159 --> 00:09:54,429
With a wet wipe?

237
00:09:55,969 --> 00:09:57,239
- The hole. - Is that necessary?

238
00:09:57,399 --> 00:09:58,669
Gosh, she's so clean.

239
00:10:02,769 --> 00:10:04,879
(She finishes cleaning the bottom of the washer in a flash.)

240
00:10:06,079 --> 00:10:08,449
